1: :S(L) succ
   1 :S fired
2: :S(L) fail -> fallthrough
   2 fall-through (correct)
3: :F(L) fail
   3 :F fired
4: :S(L):F(L) fail -> F
   4 :F fired
5: :S(L):F(L) succ -> S
   5 :S fired
6: :S(L)F(L) fail -> F
   6 :F fired
7: :F(L):S(L) succ -> S
   7 :S fired
8: :F(L):S(L) fail -> F
   8 :F fired
9: :(L) unconditional
   9 :(L) fired
10: :S(L1):S(L2) succ -> first :S wins
   10 first :S fired (correct)
11: :F(L1):F(L2) fail -> first :F wins
   11 first :F fired (correct)
12: :S(L1):S(L2):F(L3) -- :S(L1) wins, :S(L2) dead
   12 :S(L1) fired (correct)
13: IDENT(SUBSTR(s,p,l), Y) succ -> :S
   13 :S fired (correct)
14: IDENT(SUBSTR(s,p,l), Y) fail -> :F
   14 :F fired (correct)
15: IDENT(Y, SUBSTR(s,p,l)) succ -> :S
   15 :S fired (correct)
16: EQ(SIZE(s), n) succ -> :S
   16 :S fired (correct)
17: IDENT(SUBSTR(...), Y) :(JUMP)
   17 :(L) fired (correct)
